; Summit (issue #377, a King of the Hill stage): a stepped tower in the middle
; of a wide floor. The hill is fixed on top of the tower; side platforms and two
; bounce pads give four approaches. (Stage.hill_spots: HillSpot0.)
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for King of the Hill, and in any
; other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time ("_other").

